    "created_at": "2016-11-29T16:17:35Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-11-29T16:17:35Z",
    "body": "> Removing a TextTrack object that comes from a track element removes the element (existing behavior).\r\n\r\nDo you mean the fact that removing the track element from the document also removes the TextTrack object from the media element's `textTracks` list? This would be the other way around, but I think it'd be OK to make the behavior symmetrical if that's what you mean.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
