    "created_at": "2016-11-29T16:40:23Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-11-29T16:40:23Z",
    "body": "I think the symmetrical behavior for removing the track element vs track object on the `textTracks` list makes sense.\r\nI think that just forgetting the in-band track rather than throwing would be a better approach as it matches more closely what happens with the track elements. It'll also be a signal to the browser that we don't care about parsing the rest of this track until the source gets reset.",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
